{"slug": "weesp", "synopsis": "This silent, black-and-white film records the waterways, streets, buildings, and residents of Weesp. Cyclists and pedestrians cross a raised wooden bridge and move through narrow brick streets, while a moored sailing vessel and buildings line a canal.\\\\n\\\\nViews of residents include children gathered near a bridge and a seated woman working beside large baskets. A prominent church and clock tower rise above the trees and surrounding town, emphasizing Weesp\u2019s historic architecture alongside scenes of everyday life.", "clips": [{"id": "4e9dea6c-c464-5f22-8dde-4627c1872097", "sourceSlug": "weesp", "sourceTitle": "Weesp", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 12.2, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/clips/0000000000-0000012200.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/thumbnails/0000000000-0000012200.jpg"}, {"id": "8f511cad-8a1e-54f6-b0fc-2385407f34ad", "sourceSlug": "weesp", "sourceTitle": "Weesp", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 12.2, "endSeconds": 18.6, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/clips/0000012200-0000018600.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/thumbnails/0000012200-0000018600.jpg"}, {"id": "a6674233-f199-5172-a64e-9b0471432d73", "sourceSlug": "weesp", "sourceTitle": "Weesp", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 18.6, "endSeconds": 23.8, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/clips/0000018600-0000023800.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/weesp/thumbnails/0000018600-0000023800.jpg"}, {"id": "e73c92a0-7270-5a04-ad58-00b1d3051ad7", "sourceSlug": "weesp", "sourceTitle": "Weesp", "sourceYear": 1928, "position": 3, "startSeconds": 23.8, "endSeconds": 43.6, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c0